  "display_name": "Precise Strike",
  "display_fullname": "Tanker Melee Staff Fighting Precise Strike",
  "display_help": "You attempt to daze your foe with a heavy staff blow  to their head.  Precise Strike has a higher chance to hit than normal,  deals Moderate Smashing damage, and has a small chance to disorient the  target briefly.   While a form is active, this power will build one level of Perfection. This power can bruise an enemy, making them more vulnerable to damage.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast.",
